{"id":"feitic_o","lemma":"feitiço","pos":"noun","rank":1697,"glosses":["spell, incantation","witchcraft, sorcery","amulet, charm"],"ipa":"/fɐjˈti.su/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"feitiços"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Jessie_Edwin_Lawrence-feiti%C3%A7o.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom caiu rapidamente sob o feitiço de Mary.","en":"Tom quickly fell under Mary's spell.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to fall","l":"cair"},{"g":"rapidly, quickly"},{"g":"under"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"A bruxa má lançou um feitiço maligno no homem e o transformou num inseto.","en":"The wicked witch cast an evil spell on the man and turned him into an insect.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"witch"},{"g":"bad","l":"mau"},{"g":"to launch","l":"lançar"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"malign"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"male"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to transform","l":"transformar"},null,{"g":"insect"}]}]}